Files and Office tool package

Tool schemas, descriptions, argument policy and localized display metadata are
adapted from Sailry 5bfeaf05:
plugins/builtin/files/agent/mod.rs
plugins/builtin/files/agent/schema.rs
plugins/builtin/files/office/agent.rs
plugins/builtin/files/desktop/messages.rs
plugins/builtin/files/office/messages.rs
crates/protocol/src/office.rs
locales/en.yml and locales/zh-CN.yml

The Office Read and Export JSON schemas were extracted using the pinned
schemars implementation and the compiled Sailry protocol types. Tool icons
preserve GPUI Kit b79f4ce vector geometry from:
crates/assets/assets/icons/book-open.svg
crates/assets/assets/icons/file-text.svg
crates/assets/assets/icons/folder-open.svg
crates/assets/assets/icons/search.svg
Only unused CSS class attributes and whitespace were removed. The upstream
Apache-2.0 license is included in LICENSE-APACHE.

Worktree scope, filesystem confinement, revisions, checkpoints, approval,
durable outcomes, Office libraries and native renderers remain in Sailry core.
Handlers preserve the complete native Output envelope without formatting it.

Desktop composition, file action policy, tab selection, directory paging,
search drafts and localized captions are adapted from Sailry 116aab0f:
plugins/builtin/files/desktop/files.rs and its file_* modules
apps/desktop/src/resources/tabs.rs
apps/desktop/src/resources/document_footer.rs
apps/desktop/src/file_list.rs
locales/en.yml and locales/zh-CN.yml

The package composes GPUI Kit controls through the public desktop SDK. Native
document surfaces, editing history, platform menus, file previews, confined
file access, system dialogs, transfers and pending requests remain in core.
